  "status": "prose",
  "value": "Used via the Hugging Face transformers library (transformers==4.57.1, Python 3.11) with AutoProcessor and AutoModelForImageTextToText (trust_remote_code=True); the chat format is built with processor.apply_chat_template on messages with user content of text, video or image items; molmo_utils is used for video processing. Quick start examples cover video QA, video pointing, video tracking, multi-image QA and multi-image pointing.",
  "quote": "pip install transformers==4.57.1 [...] pip install torch pillow einops torchvision accelerate decord2 molmo_utils [...] from transformers import AutoProcessor, AutoModelForImageTextToText [...] inputs = processor.apply_chat_template(\n    messages,\n    tokenize=True,\n    add_generation_prompt=True,\n    return_tensors=\"pt\",\n    return_dict=True,\n) [...] ### Tracking Video QA (best with max_fps=8)",
  "quotes": [
   "pip install transformers==4.57.1",
   "pip install torch pillow einops torchvision accelerate decord2 molmo_utils",
   "from transformers import AutoProcessor, AutoModelForImageTextToText",
   "inputs = processor.apply_chat_template(\n    messages,\n    tokenize=True,\n    add_generation_prompt=True,\n    return_tensors=\"pt\",\n    return_dict=True,\n)",
   "### Tracking Video QA (best with max_fps=8)"
